18:["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4","children":"Kalkulyatordan qanday foydalanish"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-sm sm:prose-base max-w-none text-muted-foreground space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Kalkulyator qanday ishlaydi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Kommunal xizmatlar kalkulyatori O'zbekistondagi barcha asosiy kommunikatsiyalar uchun oylik to'lovlarning to'liq qiymatini hisoblaydi: elektr energiya, tabiiy gaz, sovuq va issiq suv, oqava suv (kanalizatsiya), chiqindilarni chiqarish va domofon. Barcha tariflar 2025–2026-yilning amaldagi stavkalari bo'yicha hisoblanadi."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash formulasi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"O'zbekistonda o'rtacha oylik kommunal to'lovlar (2025–2026): Toshkentda 2 xonali kvartira — 400 000-800 000 so'm (yoz) va 600 000-1 200 000 so'm (qish); 3 xonali kvartira — 500 000-1 000 000 so'm (yoz) va 800 000-1 500 000 so'm (qish); gaz isitishli xususiy uy — 300 000-600 000 so'm (yoz) va 1 500 000-3 000 000 so'm (qish)."}]]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Hisoblash misoli"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Oddiy kvartira uchun kommunal to'lovlar tarkibi: elektr energiya — 30-40%, gaz — 20-40% (mavsumga qarab), suv — 15-25%, chiqindi chiqarish — 5-10%, domofon/xizmat — 5%."}]]}]]}],["$","div","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Nimalarni hisobga olish kerak"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"O'zbekistonda kommunal xizmatlar tariflari davlat tomonidan tartibga solinadi, lekin turli darajada belgilanadi. Elektr energiya va gaz butun mamlakatda bir xil narxda va progressiv shkala bo'yicha hisoblanadi: iste'mol qancha ko'p bo'lsa, shuncha qimmat. Suv, kanalizatsiya va chiqindi olib chiqish tariflarini viloyat kengashlari tasdiqlaydi, hududlar o'rtasidagi farq bir necha baravargacha yetadi, shuning uchun kalkulyatorda hudud tanlanadi. Isitish va issiq suv tariflari ham har bir shaharda o'zgacha: kalkulyator Toshkent tariflarini qo'yadi, o'zingiznikini kvitansiyadan kiritish mumkin. Har bir xizmatni batafsil hisoblash uchun alohida kalkulyatorlardan foydalaning: elektr energiya, gaz va suv."}]]}]]}],["$","div","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-2","children":"Foydali maslahatlar"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"leading-relaxed","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Kommunal to'lovlarni optimallashtirish bo'yicha tavsiyalar: barcha resurslarga hisoblagichlar o'rnating (suv bo'yicha 30-50% gacha tejash); energiya tejovchi asboblardan foydalaning; isitish xarajatlarini kamaytirish uchun uy-joyni izolyatsiya qiling; o'z vaqtida to'lang — kechikish uchun penya hisoblanadi."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 space-y-6","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-foreground","children":"Ma'lumotnoma va tariflar"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-border","children":["$","table",null,{"className":"w-full text-sm","children":[["$","caption",null,{"className":"px-4 py-2 text-left font-medium text-foreground bg-muted/50 border-b border-border","children":"Elektr energiya tariflari (so'm/kVt·s)"}],"$L1e","$L1f"]}]}],"$L20","$L21","$L22"]]}],"$L23","$L24"]}]
